<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rom</book>
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rom</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Jesu Khrist suoh, sawltah hi ding a hat, Pasian khantan hoi dinga guottuom in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khantan hoi Pasian in masanglai a guolneite tungtawn a Laisiengthou a ana chiemsa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tahsa dan a David suon a pieng, a Tapa Jesu Khrist, i Mangpa uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sienthouna hagau lam dan a, shina apat a thawkiana in, silbawltheina toh Pasian Tapa ahina aphuonkhietna tungtang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama min zieh a ginna thumanna nam chin lah a aum theina dingin, Ama ziehin hepina leh sawltah hina itangta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate lah ah noute zong Jesu Khrist a hatte na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian deitah, misiengthou hi dinga hat: Rom khuo a um zousiete kungah; i pa uh Pasian leh Jesu Khrist kunga kipat hepina leh hamuonna na kung uah umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amasapen in, na ginna thu uh leitung pumpia akigenthang tah ziehin, noute zousie tunga ka kipahna, Jesu Khrist zal in ka Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen ka thungetnate ah, tawplou in na min uh ka lou ngitnget hi chi, A Tapa khantanhoi a ka hagau a ana ka sep zing, Pasian khu ahing theipipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu beeh a noute kunga hing haw theina ding, Pasian deilam ka mu thei teitei na dingin, ka ngen na lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen noute hing detsah ding, hagau lam silpieh bang ahiei khat ka hing pieh theina dingin noute hing mu ka ut mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua pen na ginna u’leh ka ginna a khat leh khat kihanthawn tua lei ka china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, Jentel dangte lah a sepgimna ga ka mutah mabanga noute lah a zong ka mu theina dingin na kung uah tamveipi hing haw ka tumta hi, hinanleh tu dongin dalin ka um hi, chi na theilou uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Greekte leh namngiemte lah leh mi pil leh mi pilloute kungah zong bat ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n nou Rom khuo a umte kungah zong khantanhoi theitawp a gen dingin kimansa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ken Khrist khantanhoi ka zumpi sih hi, aziehpen agingta pouma dinga tam pen hundamna dinga Pasian silbawltheina ahi, Judate a dingin ahi masa a, tualeh Greekte dingin zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen tua khantanhoi sungah, Pasian in adihtatna alangsahta hi. “Mi dihtat khu ginna in ahing ding chi gel bangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dihtatlouna a thutah nuoinet mite, Pasian ngaisahlouna leh dihtatlouna zousie tungah Pasian lungthahna van akipat in ahing kilangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian in atheisah tah ziehin, Pasian in tanchin thei ding khu amauah chientah a theisahin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen leitung siemchil a kipat a A silmutheiloute, Akumtawn silbawltheina leh a Pasian zie natan dong chieng silsiem ah akilanga, chientah a mu in a um hi. Tuaziehin mihingten suonlam ding anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaun Pasian theinapi in, Pasian bangin apahtawi sih ua, kipahthu zong agen sih uhi, hinanleh alungsim uah sil thulimloute angaituo zawta ua, alungtang motnate uh amiel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pil kisa nan u’leh ahing mawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A shi theilou Pasian thupina khu ashi thei mihingte, vate, kenglinei sate leh abohvah ganhingte, kibahpi a bawl milimte in ahengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian in amaute khu lungtang gitlouna bangbanga numei pasal kaala thanghuoitah a buol ding leh apumpi uh pahtattah a kizangtuo dingin ahazanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabang miten Pasian thutah zuou toh hengtuoin asiempa sangin asilsiemte abie ua, ana zong asem zawta uhi, asiempa khu kumtawn a phattah ahi, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamte ziehin Pasian in zumhuoi taha ahua uh phal in ahazanta hi. Anumeite uh nasan zong apienpi umdan ngaina uh, banglouin akizang zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuamabangin pasalte zong numei zahdan ngaina tawpsanin, huain aki enla ua, pasal leh pasal zumhuoi tahin akizangtuo ua, atatsietna man amu ding ukhu ama uah akimu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh alungsim ua Pasian athei utlou ziehun Pasian in sil kilawmloute bawl dingin adeilou lam lungsim nei phal in ahazanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Dihtatlouna zousie, hua a lanna zousie, gitlouna zousie, du amna zousie, kimudana zousie a dim in, thangsietnate, tuolthanate, kihaunate, kisolnate, mi sietna ding ngaituonate in adim ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thudap genhatte, Pasian mudate, misimmaw hatte, kiliensahte, kithuneisahte, silgilou pandoh mite, nu leh pa thumangloute;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Theisiemna neiloute, muonhuoina beite, itna beite, ngaidamna neilou leh hepina neiloute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tambang sil bawlte shitah mawng ahi uh chi leh Pasian thukhenna dih ahi chi theinapi in amauh bawl guoh zong hilouin midang tambang bawlte zong akipahpi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aw mihing, mi selhat koi hinan lachin zong suonlam ding mawngmawng neilou na hi, aziehpen midangte na mawsahna mama ah nangma siemlou kitangsah na hi; nang mi mawsahpain, amauh na mawsahna silte mama na bawl ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh tambang bawl mite tungah Pasian thukhenna khu thutah dungzui in atung hi chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw nang mihing tambang bawl mite mawsah napia tuabang silte na bawl zel leh, Pasian thukhenna pel thei dingin na kingaisut amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahisihleh Pasian hoina dawzouna leh thuoh hatna, hoina hausatna simmaw na hiei mah? Pasian hoinain kisiana ah nang ahingpui chi theilou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh na lungtang khau dungzui a na kisia nuomlou ziehin, Pasian thangpaina ni leh thukhenna dihtat ahing kilat ni chienga ding in thangpaina na kikholkhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n michin asilbawl dungzui un, athuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuohhatna zieh a silhoi bawl teitei a, thupina, pahtawina leh shi theilouna sui mite kungah kumtawn hinna ape dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh amauh angsung khuola, thutah zuilou a, dihtatlouna zuite tungah, lungthahna leh thangpainate a um ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuohgimna leh lunggimna nasatah, silgilou bawlte hagau tungah aum dinga, Judate hagau tungah aum masa ding a, Greekte hagau tungah zong a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh silhoi bawl poumate kungah, thupina, pahtawina leh lungmuonna pieh ahi dinga Judate kunga pieh masah ahi dinga, tualeh Greekte kungah zong pieh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in deisah tuom anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dan neilou a khelna bawl zousie, dan lou in amangthang ding ua, Dan nuoi a khielte zousie lah dan banga thukhenpieh in aum ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen dan za mite pen Pasian mitmuin midih ahi sih ua, hinanleh dan banga bawlte pen midih ahi ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen dan neilou Jentelten amaute ngaina dan abawl chiengun, dan nei sih nan u’leh tuate ama-ua dingin dan khat asuoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Alungtang uah dan silbawlte akigiel hi chi alangsah uhi, tua khu asie leh pha theina un atheipi a, alungsimte uh kiniel in, siem leh siemlou akitangsah kawi kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka khantanhoi gen dungzui a Pasian in Jesu Khrist zanga mihingte thuguh, vai ahawmpieh ni chiengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai vawi, nang Judami kichi na hi a, dan na suong a, Pasian na kisahtheipi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasian deilam nathei a, dan a hilin na um a sil hoi zawte na khenthei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh nangma ngel khu mittote puipa leh miel a umte dinga vah hiin na kithei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dan a pil leh thutah umdan theina na nei zieh in, mi mote hilpa leh naungehte hilpa in na kigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang midangte hilpa, nangma kihillou na hiei mah? Guhtat lou ding ahi chia thugenpa’n, na gu zel maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang, angkawmlou ding ahi chia genpa’n, ang na kawm zel maw? nang, milim kidahpa’n, milim biehna inn a milimte na gu zel maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang, dan suongpa’n, na dan bawsiet ziehin Pasian na suminse zel maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Noute ziehin “Jentelte lah ah Pasian min gensiet in a umta hi,” chi a gel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dan na zuileh, teptan in phattuomna anei hi, hinanleh dan botse mi na hileh na teptan pen tanlou toh kibang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaziehin teptan lou miin dan thusete azui leh ateptanlou khu atan banga ngai hilou ding ahiei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngaina dan a teptanlou mi in dan azuikim leh, nang, dan laibu leh teptan dan agel a nei napi a, dan botse mi khu ahing mawpai sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Apudanga Judami hi pen, Judami tahtah ahi sih a, akilanga tahsa maimai a teptan zong teptan chietvawt ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hinanleh asunggil a Judami hi khu, Judami chietvawt ahi, tualeh teptan chietvawt khu lunggil lam a tan ahi; dan laibu a gel mai hilouin, hagau ah ahizaw hi, Ama pahtat law khu mihing apat ahi sih a, Pasian apat ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuabang ahileh, Judami in bang hamphatna ahiei anei tuom uh? ahisihleh teptan zong bang ahiei aphattuomna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lam chintengah aphatuom hi; amasapen in Pasian kamsuohte amaute kunga kepsah a um hizieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute lah a pawlkhat in gingta sihta u’leh bang achi diei? Agintat louna un Pasian ginumna bangmalou asuohsah diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suohsah lou e, Pasian khu midihtat hi henlen, michin zuou thei hizaw heh, “Na thugen a siemtanga na um theina dingin, thukhenpieh a na um chieng a zong, na zaw theina dingin,” chi a gel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh i dihtatna in Pasian dihtatna asuhlat hoi sem leh bang igenta diei? Pasian in itung ua athangpaina ahing tun sah chiengin, dihtatlou ahi diei? Mihing bangin ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hivawtlou e, aziehpen tuabang hitaleh Pasian in leitung pumpi vai bangchin ahawmta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivang in ka zuou gen zieh a, Pasian dihna, Ama thupina ding khop a alatsah sem leh, bang dinga kei mikhiel banga siemmaw tansah a um nalai ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh mi pawlkhat in ahing gensie ua, igenloupi ahing gensah bang ua, silhoi ahing pawt theina dingin sil hoilou i bawl ding uh bangding a chi zaw mailou ihi uoi? tuabang miten siemlou atan uh adih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahileh bang? Amauh sangin eite i hoizaw tuon uh amah? Hoizaw mawngmawng lou! Judate leh Jentelte ani un khelna thunuoi ah a um siengta uh chiin kichientahin ingoh masa ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Midihtat koima a um sih, khat zong a um sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A theisiem koima a um sih, Pasian sui koima a um sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A unpi un alampielmang siengta ua, a unpi un phattuomna neilou asuoh siengta uh; Koima silhoi bawl a um sih ua, khat zong a um sih.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Alawl uh han kihong ahia, a lei un solna thu agen ua,” amuh uah gulgu a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Akam uh hamselawna leh, khatna in adim a,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Akengte uh sisan suo dingin, anawsuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Manthaina leh lungzinna, alampi uah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungmuonna lampi, athei sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Amit uah Pasian ginna mawngmawng, a um sih hi,” chiin ana kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dan in sil bangpou agen pouma, kam chinteng hum a a um theina ding leh, leitung pumpi Pasian mai a mawtanga aum theina ding un, dan nuoi a umte kunga agen ahi chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin dan silbawlte ziehin, koima Pasian mitmu a siemtangin a um sih ding uh, aziehpen dan ziehin khiel kiphawhna ahing um zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang dan leh guolneiten atheipina bangun, dan loua Pasian dihtatna sulat in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tampen Jesu Khrist gintatna zieha, agingta poumate dinga sulat a um, Pasian dihtatna khu ahi. Alamdanna tuom bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen mi zousie in sil abawlkhielta ua, Pasian thupina atang zouta sih ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a um tatna zala ahepina in manbei a siemtansah in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasian thuohtheina zieh a nidanglai a akhelnate uh kitheimawbawla a um ziehin dihtatna etsahna dingin Khrist Jesu khu asisan a ginna zieh a khelna thupha tawina hi dingin Pasian in aguot a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama khu midihtat ahitheina ding leh, Jesu gingta poumate siemtangsahpa ahitheina dinga tulai hun a dihtatna etsahna ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahileh kisahtheina ding heiah a um ei? A um thei mawngmawng sih hi. Bang danin ahiei? danzuina silbawl in ahiei? Hilou, ginna dan in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin dan silbawlte zieh hilouin, ginna ziehin mi siemtangin ingai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasian khu Judate Pasian guoh ahiei mah? Jentelte Pasian zong hilou ahiei mah? Hi e, Jentelte Pasian zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Teptante agintatna zieh ua siem tangsah ding leh, teptan loute zong agintatna zieh ma ua, siemtangsah ding Pasian khat maimai a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahileh ginna ziehin dan khu bangmalou isuosah uh ahiei mah? Suohsah vawtlou, dan khu isukip zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuabang ahileh tahsa dan a ipu uh Abraham in amu tungtang, bang igenta diei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nasep zieh a Abraham siemtansah a na um hileh suon ding bang ahiei khat anei hi, hinanleh Pasian mai ah anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Laisiengthou in bang ahiei agen? “Abraham in Pasian agingta a, tua ginna khu ama a dinga dihtatna a ngai ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nasem mi thaman pen hepina a pieh ahi sih a, bat a ngai ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh nasemlou a, Pasian ngaisah loute siemtangsahpa gingta zaw mi ginna khu dihtatna a ngai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi, Nasep tellou a, Pasian in dihtat a angai mi hamphatna khu, David in zong:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Dan bei a atatkhelnate uh ngaidam a um mite leh, akhelna uh khumanga umte ahampha uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n khelna nei a asimloute ahampha hi, chiin ana gen bangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahileh tua hamphatna teptante tung maimai a um ahiei? ahisihleh teptan loute ding zong ahiei? Abraham ginna khu dihtatna a simtel ahi, ichi ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahileh tuakhu bangchi kisimtel ahiei? ateptan nuain ahiei? ahisihleh ateptan masangin ahiei? ateptan nuain ahisih a, ateptan masangin ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman teptan loua aum lai a, aginna zieh a amu dihtatna pen chiemtenain teptan ahizaw hi; teptanlou hinan u’leh, agingta zousie pa ahitheina dingin, dihtatna khu amaute dinga zong simtel ahitheina dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh teptan loute a dinga, teptante pa guoh ahisih a, ipu uh Abraham teptan lou a a um lai a, aginna nei banga neite pa zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham leh ahah asuonte kunga leitung gouluo dinga thuchiem pen dan zieha chiem ahisih a, ginna a ditatna zieh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen dan zui mite gouluotu ding na hita u’leh, ginna pen bangmalou ahita dinga, thuchiem zong panna bei ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen dan in Pasian thangpaina apieng sah a, dan umlouna ah dan bawsietna zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin hepina zieh ahitheina dingin ginna ziehin ahi; hahlesuonte zousiein zong thuchiem khu pellou a amu na dingun; dan nei mite guoh hilouin i unpi ua ipu uh Abraham banga ginna nei zousie in zong amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nam tampite pain ka hing bawlta hi, chia Laisiengthou a kigiel bangin;” agintatpa Pasian mitmu in ama eite pa ahita. Tua Pasian khu ahi, mishite hinna pie a, sil umloute nasan a umsa banga genpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kinep huoi um vawtlou napi in, aman kinem tahin agingta a, nam tampite pa ahing hitheina dingin; “Tuabangin nahah nasuonte ahing hi ding chia kigen dungzuiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ginna a hatlou tuom louin, atahsa shisa banga um leh (ama khu kum za phiel ahita a), Sarah nauneiloua chiing zong angaituo vateh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ginlelna ziehin Pasian thuchiem tahsang louin a um sih a, ginna ah ahat a, Pasian apahtawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in athuchiemsa khu atangtung sah thei hi chi theiin agingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin aginna khu “Adihtatna a simtel ahita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ginna pen dihtatna a simtel ahi chi, “Ama zieh guoh a kigiel ahi sih a;” hinanleh eite a dinga kigiel zong ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu mishi lah a kipat a kaithoupa Pasian igintatnain, eite zong iginna dihtatna in ahing simtelpieh mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua Jesu khu itatkhelnate ziehin piehkhietin a um a, tualeh siem itanna dingin kaithawin a um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin ginna zieha siemtansah a um in i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist vangin Pasian toh kilem in i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ginna zieh main eiten hepina huongsung lut theina ineita uhi, tuin eite tua hepina ah iding uhi, tualeh Pasian thupina a kinem in nuomin zong i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuami guoh hilouin, gimthuohnain kukalna apiengsah hi chi theiin, gimthuohna ah zong ikipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh kukalnain theichienna asiem a, theichienna in kinepna asiem hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kinepna in ahing lungkesah sih a, aziehpen tua Hagau Siengthou ikung ua ahing piehin Pasian itna ilungtang uah asungbuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen ihatlou lai in, ahuntahin Khrist khu Pasian ngaisah loute dingin ahing shita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midihtat tanga shingam mi akikhat dinga hinanleh mi hoi tanga shingam mi aum khamaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mikhiel ihi lai nangawn in zong, Khrist itaanga ahing shina ah Pasian in ahing itna khu phat taah in alangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaban ah asisana siemtansah a i um nuain Ama ziehin Pasian thangpaina apat in hundam in i um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen melma ihi lai a bawn A Tapa shina zieh a Pasian toh kilem ihitah u’leh, kilem a iumzaw nua un, ahinna ziehin hundam in i um zaw sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuami guoh hilouin, tua kilemna hing musahpa i Mangpa Jesu Khrist ziehin Pasian ah nuomin i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi khat ziehin leitungah khelna ahing lut a, tualeh khelna zieh in shina ahing lut a, tualeh mi zousie ana kheltah ziehin, shina in mi zousie ajelsuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen dan um masang tanin khelna leitung ah a umta hi, hinanleh khelna umlou laiin khelna khu khelna a ngai ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahivang in Adam akipata Mosi tandongin, Adam khelna banga silbawlkhiel loute tung nangawn ah zong shinain vai ahawm hi. Adam khu ahing pei dingpa etsahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh silthawnpieh khu gitlouna toh kibang ahisih hi, aziehpen mi khat gitlouna zieha bawn mi tampi ashileh, Pasian hepina leh mi khat Jesu Khrist hepina zieh a silthawnpieh khu mi tampi tungah vuain a um ngei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh silthawnpieh khu, mi khat khelna zieh a sil hing um toh akibang sih hi; aziehpen siemlou tansahna thukhenna khu mi khat ziehin ahing um a, hinanleh silthawnpieh khu khelna tampite ziehin siemtansahna dingin ahing um zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat tatkhelna zieh a shina in, tua mi khat ziehma a vai ahawm leh, Pasian hepina kiningching leh dihtatna silthawnpieh muten mi khat Jesu Khrist ziehin hinna ah vai ahawm ngei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi khat tatkhelna zieh a siemlou tansahna thukhenna khu mi zousie tungah ahing um a; tuabangmain mi khat dihtatna silbawl ziehin hinna muna dingin siemtansahna silthawnpieh khu mi zousie tungah ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen mi khat thumanlou zieh a mi tampite mikhiel akihisah mabangin, mi khat thumanna ziehin mi tampite midihtat hisah ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuathamlou in gitlouna atam semna dingin dan ahing umbelap na lai a, hinanleh khelna apunna phot ah, hepina zong apung zawsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khelnain shina a vai ahawm mabangin hepina in dihtatna zieh a vai ahawm theina dingin, hepina in i Mangpa Jesu Khrist ziehin kumtawn hinna ahing tun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahileh bang igenta diei? Hepina apun semna dingin, khelna ah ium ngitnget ding uh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Um ngitnget lou e! Eite khelna a shisate, bangchin khelna ah ihing thei nalai diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite Khrist Jesu a baptis a um poumate khu A shina ah baptis in i um uh chi theilou na hi uoi mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pa thupina in mishi lah a kipat in Khrist a kaithaw banga eite zong hinna tha a i hin theina dingun ashina ah baptis in ama toh vuiin i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen a shina kibatpi a ama toh ina kizoptah u’leh, athawkiana kibatpi in zong ikizop ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khelna tahsa mangthai sah a ium theina dingin leh khelna suoh a i um nawnlouna dingun i mihing lui uh Ama toh kilbeh in a um hi, chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen koizong a shisa mi pen khelna apat zalensah ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite Khrist toh shikhawm i hitaah u’leh, Ama toh hin zong i hinkhawm ding uh ahi chi i gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist khu mishi lah a kipat kaithawin a um a, ashi nawn sih ding chi ithei a, shina in atung ah thu anei nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ashina khu khelna lam thu ah kumtawn a dinga khatvei shi ahia, hinanleh ahinna pen, Pasian lam ah ahing ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabangmain noute zong khelna lam thu ah ashisa in kingai unlen, hinanleh Pasian lam ah pen i Mangpa Jesu Khrist zal in ahingin kingai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin na tahsa uh deigawnate na zui na ding un, na tahsa uh shithei ah khelna in vaihawm sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tahsa hiengte uh zong dihtatlouna vanzah ding in khelna kungah pe sih un; hinanleh mishi lah a kipat a hing kia bangin, Pasian kungah kipie unlen, na tahsa hiengte u’zong dihtatna vanzah dingin Pasian kungah pe zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen khelnain na tung uah, thu anei nawn sih ding hi, aziehpen dan nuoi a um na hisih ua, hepina nuoi a um na hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahileh bang chita ding? Dan nuoi a um hilou a, hepina nuoi a um i hiziehin, i khiel ding uh ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khiel laizang lou e. Shina dinga khelna suoh hiin, dihtatna dinga thumanna suoh hitahleh, koipou kungah zong thumang dinga suoh a na kipiehlut chiengun, athu na manpa uh suoh na hi uh chi, na kithei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian kungah kipahthu um hen, khelna suoh na hinan ulachin zong, noute hing kipie kihilna thu dan khu lunglut tahin na zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khelna akipat zalensah in na hing um ua, dihtatna suohte na hing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tahsa uh hatlou ziehin, mihing dan in ka gen ahi; na tahsa hiengte uh sienthoulouna leh gitlouna kunga suoh dinga nana pieh bangun, tuin na tahsa hiengte uh sienthouna dingin dihtatna kungah suoh dingin pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen khelna suohte na hilai un, dihtatna lam apat nana zalen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahileh tua na silzumpite uah, tua hun lai in ga bang ahiei na nei uh? Tua silte tawpna khu shina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin khelna akipat zalensah in na umta ua, tualeh Pasian suohte na hing hi nua un, sienthouna khopin ga na nei ua, atawpna khu kumtawn hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen khelna thaman shina ahi, hinanleh Pasian silthawnpieh khu i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist ziehin kumtawn hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, dan in mi adam sung teng atungah thu aneikhum ahi chi na thei sih uh amah? (Dan thei mite kunga ka gen ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tambangin, numei pasal neisa khu apasal damsungsie dana apasal a kaanin a um ahi; hinanleh apasal ashi leh pasal lam thu ah dan akipat zalensahin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal dam na lai pi a, mi dang akitenpi leh angkawmnu akichi ding hi; hinanleh apasal ashi leh tua dan akipat in a zalenta a, mi dang toh kiteng nanleh angkawmnu ahi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin sanggamte aw, Pasian lam a ga inei theina dingun, mi dang khat mishi lah a kipata kaithaw a umpa na kitenpi theina ding un, Khrist tahsa ziehin noute zong dan lamah ashi na hing hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tahsa a i um lai un, dan zieha khelna utna hing piengdohsahten, itahsa hiengte ah shina khop ga suong dingin na asem leeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang eite hing na tuden dan khu i shisantah ziehin, tua dan akipat hadohin i umta hi, laigel lui bang bep hilouin, Hagau a thana toh nna i sep theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahileh bang igenta diei le? Dan khu khelna ahi diei? Hi vawtlou! Hinanleh dan zieh a thei hisihleh khelna kichi theilou ding hi-inga; dan in eng sin, na chi sihleh “Ken enna khu khelna ahi” chi ka thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh khelnain thupieh zieh a hun lemtang muin, ka sungah enna chinteng a umsah hi; dan umlouin khelna khu ashi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khatvei lai in Kei danlouin kana hinga, hinanleh thupieh ahing umtah in keima a um khelna ahing haldoh kia a, Kei ka shita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n hinna dinga thupieh khu, shina ding ahing hizawta chi ka theidohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen khelnain thupieh zieha hun lemtang muin ahing sola, thupieh zangin ahing sulumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin dan asiengthou a, thupieh zong asiengthou a, adih in ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahileh sil hoi khu kei a dinga shina hing hita adiei leh? Hilou e! Hinanleh khelna khu khelna a akilat theina dingin, khelnain silhoi zangin keima ah shina ahing semdoh hi; Khelna khu thupieh zieh a khelna nasatah ahing hitheina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan pen hagau lam sil ahi chi i thei hi, hinanleh kei pen tahsa mi, khelna suoh a khohsa ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka silbawl pen ka theisiem ngai sih hi aziehpen sil ka bawl utpen ka bawl sih a, hinanleh ka huotpen ka bawlzaw zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahileh, ka silbawl pen ka huotpen ahileh, dan ahoi chia zui ka ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua silbawlpa khu kei ka hi nawn sih a, ka sunga um khelnain abawl ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Keima ah (ka tahsa ah) silhoi malmal ateng sih chi ka thei hi; silhoi bawl ut ka nei a, hinanleh silhoi bawl theina ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen silhoi ka bawl utpen ka bawl sih a, hinanleh silhoilou ka bawl utlou pen ka bawlzaw zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka utloupen ka bawl chiengin abawlpa keima ka hisih a, khelna keima a um bawl ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n tami dan ka hing theidohta; silhoi ka bawl ut chiengin, gitlouna keima ah ahing um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen ka sunglam mi hinna giltahin, Pasian dan tungah ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh ka tahsa hiengte ah, ka lungsim dou a nasem, dan dang khat a um hi chi ka thei hi; Tua ka tahsa hiengte a um khelna dan kungah suohin ahing pui zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi genthei hina lawmlawm ing e, Tam shina tahsa laha kipat koi ahiei hing lakhe ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist ziehin Pasian kungah kipahthu ka gen hi. Tuachi’n Keima’n ka lungsim tahtahin Pasian dan ka sem a, hinanleh ka tahsa in khelna dan ka sem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin vang, Khrist Jesu a um a, khelna dan zuilou a, Hagau dan a, umte ding in siemmaw tansahna mawngmawng aum nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist Jesu a um, hinna Hagau danin khelna leh shina dan akipat ahing zalensahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tahsa zieh a dana hatlouna zieh a, dan in abawl guollou khu, Pasian in a Tapa ngei khelna tahsa melpuo in, khelna thoidamna dinga hing sawlin, tahsa a khelna um khu siemmaw atangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tahsa dan a peilou a, Hagau dan a pei zaw eite tunga dihtatnain aphut dan khu suhtangtunga a um theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tahsa dan a hingten, tahsa lam silte a lunggul ua, hinanleh Hagau dan a hingten hagau lam silte alunggul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahsa lam silte lunggul khu shina ahi a, Hagau lam silte lunggul khu hinna leh hamuonna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tahsa lam lunggulna khu Pasian toh kimelmatna ahiziehin, tuakhu Pasian dan nuoi ah a um sih a, um zong a um thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabanga tahsa a umten Pasian akipahsah thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian Hagau nouma a um tahtah ahi nahleh tahsa ah na um sih ua, Pasian Hagau nouma sungah ateng zaw hi. Tuin mi koizong Khrist Hagau neilou khu Ama a ahi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Khrist nouma a aum leh tahsa pumpi khelna ziehin ashi ahi. Hinanleh Hagau khu dihtatna ziehin ahing ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh mishi lah a kipat Jesu kaithoupa Hagau khu nouma a aum leh mishi lah a kipat a Khrist kaithoupah nouma a um Hagau ziehin na tahsapum uh shi theite zong ahingsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute aw bat inei hi, tahsa dan a hing dingin, tahsa lah ah vang ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa dan a naum u’leh, na shi ding uhi; hinanleh tahsa silbawlte Hagau a na suhlup zel u’leh, na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian Hagauin apui poumate, Pasian tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zau a um kia dingin suoh hina Hagau na mu uh ahisih a, ta hina Hagau na mu uh ahizaw hi; tua Hagau ziehin “Abba Pa” chiin i kikou zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hagau ngei in, eima hagau toh, Pasian tate ihi chi ahing theipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabanga tate ihi u’leh gouluote, Khrist toh Pasian gou luokhawmte ihi uhi. Ama toh ithuoh khawm pouleh, Ama toh pahtawi a umkhawm thei ding i hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu hun lai a ithuohgimnate pen dachienga eite a thupina sulat a um ding toh tekah tham in ka sep sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Silsiem zousiein kinem tahin Pasian tate kilatna ding angahla mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen silsiem zousiete sil thulimlou thuthu a umsahin a umta hi, amaute ut thu hilouin, kinepna nei a amauh umsahpa ziehin ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silsiem zousie zong shi theina saltaanna akipat suotatsah ahi ding ua, Pasian tate noplenna thupi a lut ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen silsiem zousie tutan dongin thum leh nauvei natna thuohin a um uh chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Silsiemte guoh hilouin, Hagau ga masa nei eite ngei zong ta hina, itahsapum uh tatna ding ngahla in ilungsim sung uah thumin i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam kinepna ziehin hundam in i um uhi, ahivangin muthei kinepna pen kinepna ahisih hi; mi’n amusa bangdinga kinem na lai lai ding ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I mu nailou i kinep leh pen kukal tah in ingah teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuabangmain ihatlounate uah Hagau in ahing panpi zel hi; aziehpen eiten bangchi banga thungen ding ihiei chi nasan ithei sih uhi, hinanleh Hagau in kamtenga genthei guollou a thumin ahing nget pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I lungtangte vel a theichienpa’n Hagau lungsim athei a, tua Hagau in Pasian dei danin misiengthoute a dingin anget pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh sil bangkimah Pasian in Ama itte, Aman adei bang bawl dinga ahatte a dingin ahoina dingun silzousie asemkhawm chiet hi chi, ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in atheilawhte Ama Tapa bangtah a um dingin aguotlawh a, Atapa khu unau tampite lah a, ta masapen ahing hitheina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh aguotlawhte ahan nalai a, ahatte khu siematangsah nalai a, tualeh siem atansahte khu apahtawi na lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahileh tam thute ah bang igenta diei leh? Pasian ei lam a apan leh koi ahiei hingdou thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama tapa ngel zong khetlou a, i unpi ua dinga hing pepa’n bang dingin sil zousie amanbei a Ama toh hing pekhawm lou ding ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasian mi telte koiin ahiei heh ding? Siemtangsahpa lah Pasian ahi thuoi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Koiin ahiei siemmawtangsah ding? Ashi khu Khrist ahi ngal a, ahi, athoukia zawta a Pasian ziellam a uma hing nget piehpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khrist itna akipat eite hing khen ding koi ahiei? Gimthuohnain ahiei, lunggimnain ahiei, bawlsietnain ahiei, kielin ahiei, guohtanna in ahiei, shi zauhuoina in ahiei, ahisihleh namsau in ahiei, hingkhen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nangma ziehin sun nitum in thain ka um uh; gaw ding belamte bangin simtel ka hi uh, chi a kigiel bangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khen vawtlou ding; tamte zousie ah, ahing itpa ziehin guolzoute sanga tungtuong zaw ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shina ahiei, hinna ahiei, vansawlsiengte ahiei, thuneinate ahiei, silbawltheinate ahiei, tuhun a sil umte ahiei, sil hing um dingte ahiei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sanna ahiei, thuhna ahiei, ahisihleh silsiem dang mawngmawngin zong, i Mangpa uh Khrist Jesu a um Pasian itna akipat ahing khen thei sih ding chi kichien tahin ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khrist ah thutah ka gen ahi, zuou ka gen sih, Hagau Siengthou ziehin, ka sie leh pha theinain zong ahing theipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungtangah lunggimna lienpi leh gentheina beitheilou ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen tahsa dan a ka chipi ka nampi ka unaute taangin keima Khrist a pat in pampai leh hamsie thuohin um leng ka chi ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israelmi ahi ngal ua, ta hinate, thupinate, thuhunte, dan thupiehnate, Pasian nasepnate leh thuchiemte ama ua a ahi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pu leh pate ama ua ahia, tualeh tahsa lam thu ah Khrist zong amaute lah a kipata hing pawtkhie ahia, Ama pen sil zousie tunga um, kumtawn a pahtawitaah Pasian ahi. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian thu bangmalou banga umta ahisih hi. Aziehpen Israel hahlesuonte aunpi un Israelmi ahi sieng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham hahlesuonte ahivang un, Abraham tate tahtah ahi sieng tuon sih uhi. “Tuanahsangin Isaak ah na hah na suonte akichi ding chi ahi zaw hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuapen tahsa tate khu Pasian tate ahisih ua, hinanleh thuchiem tate khu Abraham hahlesuon a kisim ahizaw uh china ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen thuchiem khu tami ahi; “Tubang hunin ka hing pei dinga, Sarah in tapa anei ding,” chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua guoh ahisih a, Rebekah in zong, mi khat, ipu uh Isaak lah ah nau apai laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naupangte apien masangun, sie leh pha bangma abawl masangun, tel lam thu a Pasian silguot adet theina dingin, anasepte zieh hilouin ahanpa deina zieh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akungah a “Upa zawin anaupang zawpa nna asep pieh ding hi,” Pasian in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Jakob ka itta a hinanleh Esau ka mudata hi” chia gel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahileh bang igenta diei le? Pasian ah dihtatlouna a um a adiei? um lou e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman Mosi kungah, “Ka hepi nuomte ka hepi dinga, tualeh ka it nuomte pouma ka it ding hi, chi’n ana genta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin mihing deina zieh leh kipau bawlna zieh ahisih a, hinanleh a hepipa Pasian ziehin ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Laisiengthouin Pharaoh kung ah, “Tami tupna ziehin, nangma a ka silbawltheina ka etsah theina dingin, tualeh leitung pumpi a ka min athan theina dingin nang ka hing tungding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian in a ut pouma ahepi a, a ut pouma zong alungsim akhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n nangman ka kungah, “Bang dinga Aman i dihlouna mu nalai ahiei? Adeilam koiin akal ei?” na chi ahi kha ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw mihing, Pasian dawng ngam ding nang koi na hiei? Silsiem in asiempa kungah, “Bang dinga tambanga na hing siem ahiei, achi diei mah?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bel khengpa’n tungman tangkhat apat bel khat manpha tah a zah ding leh, thulimlou taha zah ding bel khat kheng dingin tungman tang tungah thu anei sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh lungthahna bel suhsiet dingte tunga Pasian in alungthahna leh asilbawltheina latsah a ut a, kideh zoua, athuohzou hamham leh bang akhawh diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hepina bel, thupina tang dinga masanglai apat ana guotlawhte tunga, athupina haudan asuhlat theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua khotuona belte khu Judate lah guoh a hat hilouin, Jentelte lah a kipata hat eite nangawn zong ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hosea laibu a: “Ka mi hingailoute khu, ka mite ka chi dinga, it ngailounu zong, it nu ka chi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tualeh amaute kunga, ka mite na hisih uh, akichina mun ah, Pasian hing tate akichita ding uh, ana chi bang in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israelte tungtangthu ah Isai in zong tambangin ana tangkoupi hi: “Israel tate tamdan tuipi pieu a, senel za hinan u’leh, asuohta umsunte bep, hundam in aum ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n leitunga, nna tomkhat asep ding ziehin, tua nasep khu aman azou dinga, dihtatnain a sutom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Isai main, “Mangpa silbangkim bawlpa’n, Hahlesuon hing na khoipieh lou hileh, Sodom ibangta ding ua, Gomorrah banga bawlin i umta ding hi,” chi a ana genlawh bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahileh bang igenta diei? Dihtatna suilou Jentelten ginna ziehin dihtatna amuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh dan a dihtatna sui Israelten tua dihtatna khu amu zouta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bang ziehin ahiei? Ginna in asui sih ua, dan silbawla muthei banga asui zieh uh ahi. Aziehpen kipalna suong ah akipalpua ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ngai un, Zion ah, kipalpuana suong leh, Puana suongpi ka koi hi; Koipou ama gingta azumsah sih ding hi,” chi a kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, Israelte dinga ka lunggul pen leh ka thungetna pentah khu amaute hundam ahing hitheina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen amauten Pasian lam ah phatuomngaina anei uh chi ka theipi hi, ahivangin theina dungzui ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amuten Pasian dihtatna theilou in amauh dihtatna suhdet tumin, Pasian dihtatna ah akitulut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen agingta pouma adingin Khrist khu dihtatna muna dinga dan tawpna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi in, dan a dihtatna zui mi khu tua dihtatnain a hing ding, chi’n agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinna leh ginna a dihtatnain pen tambangin agen hi, “Na lungsim in van tungah koi akal tou diei?” chi sin. (Tua pen tunglam apat Khrist hing puisuh ding, china ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahisihleh “Lei nuoi ah koi akumsuh diei?” (Tuapen mishi lah akipat Khrist puitou ding china ahi) chi sin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh bang ahiei agen? Thuin ahing nai hi, na kam leh na lungtang ah aum hi, tua khu ginna thu ka gen uh khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu Mangpa ahi chi na kam a na phuon a, mishi lah a kipat Pasian in akaithou hi chi, na lungtanga na gintat leh hundamin na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen mi’n alungtang un agingta ua, dihtatna amu uhi, tualeh akam un aphuong ua, hundamna amu zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laisiengthouin “Koipou Ama gingta khu azumsah sih ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Judate leh Greekte kilamdanna bangma aum sih hi; a unpi ua tunga Mangpa khu akibang ahia, tualeh Ama han zousiete tungah hoina ahau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen “Mangpa min han pouma hundam in a um ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahileh agintat loupi uh bangchin amin ahan ding uoi? tualeh athu azah loupi uh, bangchi’n agingta ding uoi? Agen ding mi um louin bangchin aza ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh sawl ahisih u’leh bangchi’n thu agen ding uoi? “Hamuonna khantan hoi leh, silhoi kipah huoi hing tut mite, Kalsuon khu kilawm hina e;” chia kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun a unpi un khantanhoi azui kim sih uhi. Aziehpen Isai in, “Mangpa ka thugen uh gingta koi ahiei?” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n ginna pen zahna ziehin, ahing um a, tualeh zahna khu Pasian thu ziehin, ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh aza sih uh amah? “Ka chi ahi; zatham e, athawmging uh leitung pumpi ah athang suoh a, athu uh kawlmong dongin athangta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelten athei sih uh amah? “Ka chi ahi, Amasapen in Mosi in, Nam a genthamloute zangin, thangsietna ka hing neisah dinga, nam mote zangin, Kang lungthah sah ding hi,” chiin ana genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Isai in hangsan tahin; “Kei hing sui louten ahing mudohta ua, Ka kunga hing ngen loute kungah, suhlatin ka umta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Israelte kungah, “Mi genha leh thumang loute adingin, sun nitum in ka ban ka zah hi. Chi’n agen hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken, Pasian in amite paikheta ahiei mah? Ka chi hi. Paikhe lou e! Aziehpen Kei zong Israelmi, Abraham hahlesuon, Benjamin phunga mi ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian in a theilawhsa amite apaikhe sih hi. Laisiengthouin Elijah thu agen na theisih uh amah? Aman Israelte mawsahna thu Pasian kungah atut a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mangpa na guolneite athat ua, Na maitamte asatchim ua, tualeh keima tangin ka um a, Kei zong tha ahing tum uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian dawnna bang ahiei le? “Baal mai a khupdin ngailou mi tul sagi keima dingin ka koituom hi,” chi’n adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuamabangin, tu hun laiin zong hepina a tel dungzui in, asuohta sun themkhat a um na lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh hepina zieh ahi leh vang, na sep zieh ahi nawnta sih hi, tuachilouin pen hepina khu hepina ahitasih ding hi, hinanleh nasep zieh ahileh pen hepina ahi sih ding hi, tuachilouin pen nasep zong nasep ahita sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahileh bangchi ahita diei? Israelten asui uh amu sih ua, hinanleh telten vang amu uhi, adang zousie pen khausah in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Pasian in tuni tan dongin, imut suohna hagau apie a, amu theilouna ding uh mitte apie a, azah theilouna ding uh bilte apie hi.” Chi-a kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh David in: “Amasang ua annkuong kilui khu, thang leh piel, kipalpuana leh phuba lahna suoh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amu theilouna dingun amitte uh, suhmiel in um henlen, tualeh angumgu uh kun zing heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahileh ken akipal uh khu apuadenna ding uh ahiei mah? ka chi hi. Hilou e! Hinanleh amaute puana ziehin Jentelten hundamna amu ua, Israelte athangsietna tohthou a aum theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amauh puana khu leitung pumpi a dinga hausatna ahing hi a, tualeh asupna uh zong Jentelte hausatna ahing hileh, abukimna uh bangchi zatah a hausatna ahita diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin nou Jentelte kunga ka gen ahi, Kei Jentelte sawltah ka hiziehin ka nasepna ka pahtawi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangchilam ahiei khat a, tahsa dana ka nampite ka thangsiet sah a, alah ua pawlkhat beeh ka hundam thei khah leh chi ka kinepna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh paikhieh a aumna uh, leitung pumpi toh kilem kiana ahileh, amaute pomkiana khu shina apat hin kiana loungal bang dang ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen aga masa asienthou nah pouleh, alompi zong tuamabangin asiengthou hi; tualeh ahuite asianthou leh abate zong tuamabangin asiengthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh aba khenkhatte suhtana aum a, nang gam Olive alah ua phutlut in ahing zop a Olive sing tahtah zungpi leh ahoina kikoppite na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh abate tungah kiliensah sin na kiletsah leh tami theizingin, nang abameng khat nahi giap a, azungpi vahpa nang na hisih a, azungpi in nang hing vah ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nang phulut leh zop a ka um theina dinga abamengte sattan a um ahi na chi ahi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adih hi, amauten agintatlouna zieh un sattan in a um ua, nang pen na ginna ziehin na ding ahi. Ki uongsah sinlen zau zawin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in bamengdihtahte nangawn khawilou ahileh, nang zong ahing khawi tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian hoina leh thukhaunate ngaituoin: Apuate tungah athukhau a, hinanleh nang lamah ahoi ahi; ahoina a na um zing pou leh, tuachi ahisihleh, nang zong satkhiehin na um sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh amauh zong gingta loua aumden sih pou u’leh phulutin aum ding uhi, aziehpen Pasian in amauh aphutlut thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen nang piendan a olive tahlou apat satkhieh bawn, pienken ngainaloutah a olive sing hoi a phulut a na um leh, tam Olive tah bamengte, amauh olive sing ngei ah phulutin um zaw sem lou ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen unaute aw, nouma ngai a na kipilsah louna ding un tam thuguh kiphuol Jentelte bukimna ahing tun masangsie, Israelte tungah lungtang khauna bangza ahiei hing tung tadi ahi, chi na theilou uh ka dei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Israelmi zousie hundam in a um ding uhi; Zion akipat hundampa ahing pei dinga, Jakob akipat Pasian ngaisah louna asumang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Aziehpen akhelna uh ka lahmang chienga, akung ua ka thuhun ding khu tami ahi,” chi a na kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khantanhoi lam thuah pen noute ziehin melma ahi ua, hinanleh telna thu toh kisai in pen pu leh pate zieh in it le ngaitahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian silthawnpieh leh hatna akiheng thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khatvei lai in Pasian thumang loute na hi ua, hinanleh, tuin amaute thumanlouna ziehin hepina na muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuamabangin tuin amaute zong thumangloute ahi ua, tua pen, noute tunga Pasian hepina zieha amauten zong hepina amu theina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pasian in a unpi ua ahepi sieng theina dingin, mi zousie, thumanlouna ah akhakhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aw Pasian pilna leh theina tualeh hausatna thuh hina va-ia e, A thukhennate suikhiet guollou leh! Alampite zong mukhiet guollou hina va-ia e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Mangpa lungsim koi ahiei thei? Ahisihleh koi ahiei alemguotpi a vapang ngai?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Ahisihleh koi ahiei ditkia dinga akunga sil pemasa phot?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aziehpen sil zousie Ama akipan leh, Ama vang leh, Ama a dinga silzousie um ahi; Ama kungah thupina tangtawn in um hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n unaute aw, Pasian kunga na sapum uh, kithoina hing leh siengthou leh pomtah hi dinga kilan dingin Pasian khotuona ziehin ka hing ngen ahi; tuakhu na bawl ding ua kilawm mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam leitung hindan toh kituoh in um sih unlen, hinanleh Pasian deilam hoi leh pomtah leh hoibukim bang ahiei chi na thei chienna dingun na lungsim uh atha a umin hing lamdang zawta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kunga hing kipie hepina ziehin, na lah ua mi koipou akingaisang ding hun kalval a, kingaisanglouin, hinanleh Pasian in michin ginna kihunkhop apieh bang zel a, kituptah a ngaituo zaw dingin ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sapumkhat ah hieng tampi inei ua, tualeh hieng zousie nasep akibang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n eite tampi hinanlei zong, Khrist ah sapum khat ihi ua, khat leh khat i kihiengtuo chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I kung ua hepina hing kipie dungzui in silthawn pieh tuom tuom inei chiet ua, thumavang gen ding ahileh iginna toh kituohin igen ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahisihleh, thunasep ding ahileh, sem vaiin thuhilmiin zong hil zel heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dangte hanthawn mi in zong hanthawn zel henlen, silpieh pemi in it hetlouin pie heh, vaihawmmi in thanuom tahin hawm hen, midangte hepina nei miin kipahtahin hepi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Itna khu lepchiena tellou hiheh, gilou pouma huo unlen, ahoilam pouma tu chinten un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unau ki itna in khat leh khat, kilainat tuo chiet unlen, kizabawlna lam ah kideisah tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kukalna lam ah thase sih unlen, Hagau lamah phatuom ngaitahin, Mangpa nna sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kinepna ah kipah zing unlen, gimthuohna ah thuohhat unlen, thungetna lamah hakat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misiengthoute tahsap awng hu dingin na nei nalamte uh kitanpi unlen, zin bawldan siem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou hing bawlsete guolzawl un, guolzawl unlen gausap sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipahte kipahpi unlen, kapte kaapi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khat leh khat lungsim kibangin um unlen, kisathei sih unlen, mi mawlte toh kipawl zaw unlen, nangma ngai in kipilsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Koima gitlouna gitlounain thuh sih unlen, mi zousie mitmu ah sil kilawm bawl tum zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahithei liei leh na thu ua ahithei laisie, mi zousie toh kituohin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte aw, phuba kila sih un, hinanleh lungthahna khu Pasian awn zaw un, “Phuba lah Keima a ahia, keiman ka thuhna ding, Mangpa’n achi hi,” chi’n akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuaziehin na melma agilkiel leh neh ding pie inlen, adang ata leh dawn ding piein. Tuabanga na bawl leh alutunga mei am buohkhum na hi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gitlou thuzawin um sih unlen, hoina in gilou zou zaw un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Michin atunga vaihawm thuneite thuthu in um heh. Aziehpen Pasian thu louin koima vaihawm a um sih hi; vaihawm a pangte khu Pasian guot ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin koizong vaihawmmi niel pouma Pasian lemguot niel ahi uh, tuabanga niel miten ama u’tungah thukhenna amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihawm mitepen silhoi bawl mite adingin agiinhuoi sih ua, hinanleh mi giloute a dingin mi giinhuoi ahi uhi. Ahileh vaihawmte giing loua um na ut ei? Silhoi bawl lachin apahtat na law ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen ama khu na hoina dinga Pasian nasem mi ahi, hinanleh sil hoilou na bawl leh giingin; aman namsau amawhtawi sih hi, ama pen Pasian nasem sil gilou bawlte tunga lungthahna phuba lapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin lungthahna giinna zieh bep hilouin, na sie leh pha theina ziehin zong vaihawm mi thuthu a na um ding mawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami zieh in sie zong na pieh uh ahi; vaihawmte pen tambang bawl dinga Pasian nasemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin mi zousie kungah atan ding ua kilawm pie un: Sie piehna dingpa kungah sie pie unlen, leiman piehna dingpa kungah leiman pie unlen; giin dingpa giing unlen, zatat dingpa zong zatat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ki it tuona loungal koima bangma basih un, Ama amihinpi it miin dan azuikim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen tam “Thupiehte, angkawm sin, tuol that sin, guta sin, theipitu dihlou in pangsin, eng sin,” chileh thupieh dang mawngmawng aum leh “Nangma na ki it bangin na innvengte na it ding ahi,” chiin akhaikhawm sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna in innvengte sietna ding abawl sih hi, tuaziehin, itna khu dan zuikimna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tu hun banghun ahiei chi na thei zieh un, tami bawl un, aziehpen igintat chiil lai sangin ihundamna anai zawta a, imut khanlaw ahun mamata chi hun umdan na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan abei dihdihta a, khuo vah ding ahita hi, tuaziehin miel a silbawlte paiin vah thuom in ikithuom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sun a um bangin kilawm tahin i um ding uh, huham leh zukham buoi a umlouin, hua leh numei pasal kaala thangtat a umlouin, tualeh kihau leh kithangsiet a um louin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu Khrist in kithuom unlen, na tahsa utna uh supiching dingin bangma kibawl sih un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ginna a hatlou mi khu aginlanate nielse louin ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi khat in bangkim ne thei in akigingta a, mi hatlouin pen ante louhing maimai ane hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anete’n aneloute simmaw sih henlen, tualeh aneloute’n zong anete mawsah sih heh. Pasian in ama akipahpi tah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midang suoh tunga thukhen ding nang koi na hiei? A din leh a pua ding pen apu thu ahi. Ahi, ama dinsah in aum ding hi, aziehpen Pasian in ama adingsah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in ni dang sangin ni khat angai poimaw zaw hi. Midang khat in ni chinteng kibang chietin angai hi. Michin in amauh lungsim chiet ah kitheichien u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuani tang miin, Mangpa zatatna in atang hi, tualeh ni tangloupa’n Mangpa zatatna in atang sih hi. Bangkim ne mi in Pasian kunga kipahthu agen ziehin Mangpa zatatna in ane a, tualeh anelou mi in zong Pasian kunga kipahthu gen in ane sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen koima eima a dinga hing ihisih a tualeh koima eima a dinga shi zong ihisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen i hin leh Mangpa a dingin i hinga, i shi in zong Mangpa a dingin i shi uh ahi. Tuaziehin i hin in zong ishi in zong Mangpa a ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mishite leh mi hingte Mangpa a ahitheina dingin Khrist khu ashi a, athou a, ahingkiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh nang bangdinga na unau tunga mawsah a thukhen na hiei? Ahisihleh nang bangdinga na unau simmaw na hiei? Aziehpen eite i unpi ua Khrist thukhenna toupha mai a ding ding ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mangpa’n Kei ahingzing ka hi ziehin, khup chinteng ka masang ah akun ding ua, Lei chinteng zong Pasian kungah, akiphuong ding uhi,” chi a kigiel bangin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabang ahiziehin eiten Pasian masangah eima khantan chiet igen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin eite khat leh khat kimawsahtuo nawn sih vai, hinanleh koiin zong aunau kipalna ding ahiei, ahisihleh kipuana ding bangma bawllou dingin kingaituo zaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sil bangma, ama a sienglou mawngmawng aum sih chi, Mangpa Jesu ah ka theichien a ka tahsang mama hi, hinanleh mi koipou in sil khat asiengloua angaituo leh tuakhu ama adingin asienglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh bang ahiei sil khat na neh zieh a, na unau lungsim anat leh itna dana gamta nawnlou na hita hi. Na sil neh ziehin mi khat suse sin, Jesu Khrist ama dinga shi ahizieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin na hoina u’khu ahoilou banga gen in um sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian gam khu neh leh dawn thu ahi sih a, hinanleh dihtatnate, kilemnate leh Hagau Siengthou a lungnopna thu ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tambang Khrist nasem mipen Pasian pomtah ahia, tualeh mite patat zong alaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin eite’n kilemna ding leh kisuhhat tuona ding silte idel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na neh nadawn in Pasian nasep suse sin. Sil zousie asiengthou a, hinanleh naneh nadawn zieh ua mi lungsim asuhnat leh anemi dingin ahoilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na unau puana ding ahiei, ahisihleh lungnopmawna ding ahiei, ahisihleh suhzawngkhalna ding ahiei ahileh, sa nehloute, uoin dawnloute, tualeh sil bangma bawllou ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ginna na nei amah? Pasian leh nangma kaal ah kinei in. Ama hoisahna lam a siemlou kitangsahlou mi khu ahampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh ginlana nei kawmkawma aneh leh ginna a anehlou ziehin siemloutangin aum hi, aziehpen ginna lou a bawl pouma khelna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ei ahatten eima lungnopna ding suilou in, ahatloute hatlouna ithuohpi zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Michin in i innvengte hoina dinga ilamtou ua, isuhlungkim ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist nangawn in Ama lungnopna ding angaituo sih a, “Hinanleh nou hing selphoute selphouna khu keima tungah atuta hi,” chia na kigiel bangin ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Masanglai a na kigiel pouma khu Laisiengthoua thuohhatna leh lungmuonna zieh a kinepna inei theina dinga eite kihilna dinga gel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n thuohhatna leh hamuonna Pasian in Jesu Khrist mabangin khat leh khat lungsim kibang neiin hing umsahta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n lungsim kibang leh gen kibanga, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist Pa, Pasian na pahtawi thei na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian thupina dinga Khrist in noute ahing pomtah mabangin, khat leh khat kipomtuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pu leh pate kunga thuchiemte sukip dingin Pasian thutah ziehin, Khrist pen teptante a dingin suohin ahing pangta chi noute kang hil ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahepina zieh a Jentelten Pasian apahtawi theina dingun, “Tami ziehin Jentelte lah ah, Nang kang phat dinga, Na min phat in la kasa ding hi,” chi a na kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh “Nou Jentelte aw, A mite toh lungdam un;” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Nou Jentete zousiein, “Mangpa phat un, Mizousie in zong Ama phat un,” achi kia nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isai in, “Jesse zungpi ahing zamdoh dinga, Jentelte tunga vaihawm dingin, ahing dingdoh dinga, Ama ah Jentelten kinepna anei ding uhi,” ana chi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hagau Siengthou silbawltheina zieha kinepna kiningching na nga theina dingun, kinepna Pasian in ginna a kipahna leh hamuonna chintengin hing sudimta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unaute, noute pen hoina in na dim ua, pilna kim neiin, khat leh khat na kihasot thei uh chi keima ngel in zong ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahivang in unaute, Pasian in ahing pieh hepina ziehin noute hing theidohsah kiana dan in akaal lahah thu poimaw them khat hangsantah in ka giel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentelte sillatte pomtah ahitheina ding leh Hagau Siengthou in asuhsiengthou theina dingin, Jesu Khrist khantanhoi nasep ka sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian lam silte ah, Jesu Khrist ah, kisahtheina ding ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasian thumang dinga Khrist in thugen leh nasep a, Keima zanga asilbawlte loungal bangma gen ngam ding ka nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chiemtenate leh sillamdangte in, Pasian Hagau silbawltheinain; tuachi’n Jerusalem leh akimvel gam a kipat Illirikam gam tan dongin Khrist khantanhoi kimtahin ka gen zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khrist min kilawkhah nailouna munte a khantanhoi gen ka tup ahi, tuachilou in pen midang suongphum tunga inn lam ka hi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hinanleh akhantan hoi Kigen ngailounaten amu ding ua, aza ngainailouten atheisiem ding uhi; chi a kigiel bangin gen ka tum zaw hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamte ziehin na kung ua hing haw ding tamveipi dalin ka umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin pen tam gamkai ah sepna ding mun ka nei nawn lou toh, noute kunga hing haw ding ka lunggulna kum tampi ahi taah toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain gam a ka haw chienga noute kunga hing kiban malam a, ikimutuo ding uh kinem in ka um hi. Aziehpen, noute toh kithuo zou chienga, ka khuolzinna a nouten nang panpi ding u’zong ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin pen Jerusalem a misiengthoute nasem dingin ka pei phot ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen Masidonia gam leh Akaia gam a miten Jerusalem khuo a misiengthoute lah a migentheite adingin sum tuohkhawm pha asata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amauten lungkimtah in atuohkhawm ut chiet uhi, tuabang bawl ding aleiba uh zong ahi mawng hi. Aziehpen Jentelten Judate hagau lam guolzawlna akitanpi u’leh, amaun zong a tahsa lam guolzawlnate uh Judate akitanpi uh abat uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken tam silpiehte ka piehkhiet a, asangna uh chi ka theichien zou chiengin, noute kunga hing kibang malam in, Spain gamah ka haw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Noute kunga kang haw chiengin Khrist khantanhoi guolzawlna kim toh kang haw ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, Kei a dinga Pasian kunga lunglut tah a thungen khawm dingin i Mangpa Jesu Khrist tungtawn leh Hagau itna tungtawnin ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judia gam a gingloute lah a kipat ka suotat theina ding leh Jerusalem khuo a ka nasep, misiengthoute a dinga pomtah ahitheina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ban ah, Pasian deina banga, noute kunga lungnopna toh kang haw a, i kisuhhal khawm thei chietna ding un, thu na ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lungmuonna Pasian in noute na unpi un hing umpita hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kenkrea khuo a hattuom nasem i unaunu uh Phoibi na kung uah ka hing meltheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa min a misiengthoute banga nana pom ua, panpi angaina phot a na panpi ding un, aziehpen amanu’n zong mi tampi ana panpita a, kei zong ahing panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a ka seppite Prisilla leh Akuila hing na nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten ka hinna dingin Jesu Khrist min in a ngawng uh adawta uhi; amaute tung guoh hilouin Jentel hattuomte zousie tungah zong kipahthu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangmain a inn ua hattuom kikhawmte zong hing na nousiet pieh un. Akaia gam a Khrist a ga masapen ka ittah Epenetus zong hing na nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lah ua semgim Mari hing na nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nampite lah a ka koltanpi, sawltahte lah a minthangtah, Khrist a zong kei sanga um masazaw, Andronika leh Juni hing na nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa a ka ittah Amplia hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist a iseppi uh Urbanus leh Stakis hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khrist a gin umtah Apelles, hing nousiet pieh un. Aristobulus inn sungmite hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nampi Herodion hing nousiet piehun. Mangpa a um Narkissus inn sung mite hing nousiet piehun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa a nasem Triphena leh Triphosa hing nousiet pieh un. Mangpa a nasem gim mama ka ittah Persis hing na nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangpa a tel tuom Rufus leh anu Kei nu zong hiveve, hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinkrita, Phligon, Hermas, Patrobus, Kritus, Hermes leh amaute toh umkhawm unaute hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philologus, Julia leh Neriah leh asanggamnu leh Olimpas tualeh akung ua misiengthou umte zousie hing nousiet pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kitawpna siengthou toh khat leh khat kinousiet tuo chiet un. Khrist hattuomten ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute aw, kithuhilna dan noute hing kihil lou banga kikhenna leh puana siemte melchi ding leh kiheisan dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen tuabang miten i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist nna asem sih ua, amauh gilpi nna asem zaw uhi, tualeh kamsiem leh maitangphat siem thuin mimawlte asol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na thuman dan uh mi zousie lah ah akithangta a, tuaziehin na tung uah ka kipah hi; hinanleh ahoi lam a pil ding leh aselam amawl dingin noute ka hing dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungmuonna Pasian in tomnoukaal in Setan na kephang nuoi uah ahing tuonchil sah paita ding hi. I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na tung uah umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka naseppi Timothi leh ka nampi Lusia, Jason leh Sosipater in ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima Tertius tami laihah gielpa in Mangpa min in ka hing nousiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka zintunnapa Gaius leh hattuom zousie zintunna pain noute ahing nousiet uhi. Khopi sumkempa Erastus leh unaupa Kuartus in ahing nousiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na unpi ua tungah umta hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leitung pien chiil akipat abeisa hun sawtpi na dapphuol thusim phuondoha hing um dungzui a ka khantanhoi leh Jesu Khrist thu kitangkoupina zieha noute hing phutdet thei Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin kumtawn Pasian thupieh dungzui a Laisiengthou a guolneite thugen, ginna thumanna dinga nam zousie kunga suhlat leh theisah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pasian pil umsun kungah, Jesu Khrist ziehin thupina kumtawn in umdenta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
